== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_3_Pets|Tier 3]] combination of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Ent}} and {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Risen Giant}}.

Increases profits based on a power function of your idle bonus and pet time. Increase autoclick efficiency boosted exponentially with each Summoning spell active. Increases Summoning efficiency, based on pet time.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] per second in Idle mode.

== Pet Ability ==

Autoclicks once per second, claiming the shard pool:
* <math>\text{Click Profit}\;=\;\text{Character Click Profit}</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Chance}\;=\;\text{Character Crit Chance}</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Profit}\;=\;\text{Character Crit Profit}</math>


Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>L + 30^{0.69\log_{10}(I)} \times \left(P^{0.5} + 1 \right) \times T_{H}^{6} \times \frac{L}{100\,000} + 1</math>


with

<math>T_{H} = \begin{cases}\text{Pet Real Time in Hours},&\text{ if Pet Real Time }\leq\text{ 14 days}\\
\left(336^6 + (\text{Pet Real Time in Hours} - 336)^{0.5}\right)^\frac{1}{6},&\text{ if Pet Real Time }>\text{ 14 days}\end{cases}</math>

''Note:'' <math>30^{0.69\log_{10}(I)} \approx I^{1.019}</math>


Multiplies Autoclick Profit by:
<br><math>4^{N} \times L \times \left( P^{0.4} + 1 \right) \times \frac{1}{4\,000\,000} + 1</math>



Multiplies Summoning Efficiency by:
<br><math>L \times \left( P^{0.1} + 1 \right) \times T_{D} \times \frac{1}{25\,000} + 1</math>


with

<math>T_{D} = \begin{cases}\text{Pet Time in Days},&\text{ if Pet Time }\leq\text{ 200 days}\\
200 + (\text{Pet Time in Days} - 200)^{0.5},&\text{ if Pet Time }>\text{ 200 days}\end{cases}</math>


Shards pool efficiency is multiplied by:
<br><math>L^2 \times 0.1 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>I = 1 + \frac{\text{Idle Profit Bonus}\%}{100}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>N = \text{Active Summoning Spells}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each time it autoclicks:

<math>(1 + F) \times M</math>

and each second while [[Idle Mode]] is active:

<math>(0.5 + F) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

